                    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 0;">TDS Management &amp; Statutory Compliance</h2>
                    <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px;">Manage Tax Deducted at Source entries, section rates (194C, 194J), and quarterly challan reconciliation.</p>
                </div>
